{
  "server": "jp",
  "storyId": "main_1_level_main_01-04_beg",
  "groupId": "main_1",
  "stageId": "main_01-04",
  "title": "予兆",
  "storyCode": "1-4",
  "avgTag": "戦闘前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ca103eacb3ff0e3f066574ecfec766ec8ddb373aef9f02c38b755d3fe2e37d4d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第九关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "よし……なんとか振り切ったようだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "この調子で進めば、じきにこのエリアも抜けて、南側の出口まで辿り着けそうだな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "……それにしても、進むにつれて辺りが騒がしくなってきたようだが……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "大方、チェルノボーグを離れようとした市民たちが、レユニオンと衝突しているのだろうな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "ふむ。どうやら、チェルノボーグとの連結を切って、離脱した区画もあるみたいだが……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "そっちに乗り遅れた連中が、レユニオンともめてる……ってとこだろう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "……そうか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "俺の記憶じゃ、大きな広場だったはずだ。しかし今となっちゃ「広場だったもの」って感じだな……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "……感染者を虐げ続けたこの都市が、ついに報いを受けた……ってわけか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "……Ace、お前――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "ここで、なにかあったのか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "ああ、いや。……昔の話さ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――空が……ますます暗くなってきましたね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "空気も、なんだか……焦げたような匂いがしますし……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "な、何をする――ひっ！　や、やめてくれっ！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "黙れッ、お前らが悪いんだ！　俺たちの怒りを思い知れ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "うっ……うわあああっ！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "————!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "今の声、民間人か？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "……私にも聞こえはしたが……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "あの声の主が何者かまではわからんぞ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――待ってください、あれは……レユニオン！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "誰かを攻撃しているようです！　助けに――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "待て！　この地形では、優位に立つのはまず無理だ。……非情なようだが、俺たちも無理を通せるほどの余裕はないぞ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "――いいか、アーミヤ。確かに、命は大切なものだ。しかし、お前自身の命にも、同等の価値があることを忘れるな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……っ、Aceさん……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "――！　奴ら、トドメを……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "チッ……なんにせよ、あれではもはや完全に手遅れだな……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "……これ以上気にかけてはやれん。我々も、未だ危機的な状況にあるんだ。先を急がなければ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "……皆、聞いてくれ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "――悪い知らせだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "行くぞ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "――奴らを、皆殺しにしてやれ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "――レユニオンの部隊に、広場の出口をすべて塞がれた！　気をつけろ……！　こちらへ向かってくるようだ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "やるしかないか……！　全員、構えろ！　応戦するぞ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
